                <pb facs="0665" n="579" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg579"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Combs to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-04-15"><hi rendition="#italic">April 15,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Combs reports that General Bonilla announces the surrender to his forces of
                    Tegucigalpa, and claims that normal conditions are restored in Honduras.)</p>
            </div>
